flowchart TD
    A([User Question])

    A --> B{Question Router}

    %% -------------------------
    %% Chatbot Path
    %% -------------------------
    B -->|Simple Question| C[Chatbot Baseline]

    C --> D[LLM Provider]
    D --> E[Generate Response]
    E --> F([Return Answer])

    %% -------------------------
    %% ReAct Path
    %% -------------------------
    B -->|Complex Question| G[ReAct Agent]

    G --> H[LLM Reasoning]

    H --> I{Need Tool?}

    I -->|Search Homes| J[search_homes()]
    I -->|Weather| K[get_weather()]
    I -->|Save Result| L[save_home()]

    J --> M[Observation]
    K --> M
    L --> M

    M --> N[Update Context]

    N --> O{Final Answer?}

    O -->|No| H
    O -->|Yes| P[LLM Final Response]

    P --> F
